> > Ah okay, that all makes sense! Thanks so much for your help.
> > One quick follow-up question. If I were to go with Option 2,  I would remove significant Q SNPs from the sumstats generated from the model constraining the residual variance of PHENO2 to 0, and then it would be appropriate to use the resulting sumstas for further analysis?
